    "## The Best Neighborhood and Conclusion\n",
    "\n",
    "Based on our comprehensive data analysis, **Polish Hill** emerges as the BEST neighborhood for retirees in Pittsburgh, achieving the highest composite score of 61.44. While other neighborhoods may have better individual features, Polish Hill represents the optimal intersection of security, environmental health, and accessible resources, making it the most \"Retiree-Friendly\" neighborhood in Pittsburgh."
